{{!-- Cover placement dialog: pick a book preset (Core "Common Cover SPs"), tune SP/structure,
      place a ready-made region at the view centre — then reshape with the native Region tools.

      ⭐ SAME DIEGETIC CONTRACT AS THE WALL FIELDSET (user ruling 2026-08-26): every field carries a
      SHORT book-tagged label and a plain-language `data-tooltip` naming the mechanism, the book and
      the page, and what blanking it means.

      ⭐ THE STRUCTURE FIELD IS PREFILLED AT 3 × SP AND THE PREFILL IS THE POINT. Picking a preset
      writes the Maximum Metal figure into the input WHERE IT CAN BE SEEN, so the lifecycle is
      offered rather than assumed — and blanking it (or entering 0) is the one keystroke that places
      permanent Core p.103 cover instead. The hint below says so in as many words. --}}
<div class="cp-cover-place-body">
    <p class="cp-cover-place-hint">{{CPLocal "CoverPlaceHint"}}</p>
    <p class="cp-cover-place-hint">{{CPLocal "CoverPlaceModeHint"}}</p>
    <div class="field">
        <label for="cp-cover-preset" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverPresetTip'}}">{{CPLocal "CoverPresetName"}} <span class="cp-cover-book">{{CPLocal "CoverPresetBook"}}</span></label>
        <select name="cp-cover-preset" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverPresetTip'}}">
            <option value="">{{CPLocal "CoverPresetCustom"}}</option>
            {{#each presets}}
            <option value="{{key}}">{{label}} [{{sp}}]</option>
            {{/each}}
        </select>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
        <label for="cp-cover-label" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverLabelTip'}}">{{CPLocal "CoverLabel"}}</label>
        <input type="text" name="cp-cover-label" value="" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverLabelTip'}}"/>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
        <label for="cp-cover-sp" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverZoneSPTip'}}">{{CPLocal "CoverWallSPName"}} <span class="cp-cover-book">{{CPLocal "CoverWallSPBook"}}</span></label>
        <input type="number" name="cp-cover-sp" value="10" min="0" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverZoneSPTip'}}"/>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
        <label for="cp-cover-pool" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverZonePoolMaxTip'}}">{{CPLocal "CoverWallPoolMaxName"}} <span class="cp-cover-book">{{CPLocal "CoverWallPoolMaxBook"}}</span></label>
        <input type="number" name="cp-cover-pool" value="30" min="0" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverZonePoolMaxTip'}}"/>
    </div>
</div>
